== nothing_said
error[Z0406]: `facet` needs `by`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:3
  |
3 | p.facet()
  |   ^^^^^ `by` is missing
  |
  = help: a plot is parted into panels by a variable, one panel for each of its values, as in `facet(by: industry)`; `facet(by: [industry, union])` has a panel for each pair of values

== an_empty_list
error[Z0219]: `[]` alone has no type
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:13
  |
3 | p.facet(by: [])
  |             ^^ an empty list of what?
  |
  = help: where a parameter takes the list, its type is known; elsewhere give one value

