== facets_of_a_frame
error[Z0401]: `facet` cannot be called on a Frame
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:1
  |
3 | d.facet(by: site)
  | ^ this is a Frame
  |
  = help: `facet` takes a Plot first; `x.facet(...)` is `facet(x, ...)`

