== too_many_panels_for_the_page
error[Z0401]: a page of 40 by 40 mm is too small for the 6 panels of this plot: however they are laid, it leaves each 6.1 by 6.3 mm
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:98
  |
3 | export(d.plot(x: week, y: count).points().facet(by: [site, arm, week, count]), "many.svg", size: [40, 40])
  |                                                                                                  ^^^^^^^^ too many panels for the page
  |
  = help: a panel needs 12.7 mm each way; give a larger `size:`, as `two_column` (183 by 110 mm) or a width and a height in millimetres, or part the plot by a variable with fewer values
